ription instead of a blank canvas. You say what the site should do, and the generator plans the structure, writes the copy, chooses or creates the images and produces the code. Mobirise AI adds a visual editor on top, so the result stays fully editable."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What should I look for in a free AI website generator?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Look at what happens after the first draft. A good one lets you change the result by hand as well as in chat, connect your own domain and download the code, so you can leave whenever you like. Free should also mean seeing real results before you register, which is how Mobirise AI works."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does the AI write all the text on the site?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It writes a complete first version, from the main headline to the button labels, based on what your prompt says. Names, prices and other facts come from you, so the more of them the prompt contains, the less you'll need to correct later."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which kinds of sites does it handle best?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Business sites, landing pages, portfolios, event pages, small shops and personal pages. Large web applications with user accounts or custom databases are outside what a website generator is meant for, although it's a quick way to make the marketing site that sits in front of such an app."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the AI website generator free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, and there's no sign-up to start. You can generate designs and try the editor for free, and the free plan lets you publish. Paid plans raise the limits; the current plans are on the Pricing page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need an account to try it?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No, there's no sign-up to try it. Type a prompt at the top of this page and press Generate website, and the drafts appear without registration. You'll be asked to create a free account when you want to keep the project, come back to it later or publish it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How quickly do I get a website?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The four drafts are usually ready in under a minute. The rest depends on you: some people publish the same day, others spend an evening adjusting the text and photos."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long should my prompt be?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Anything from one solid sentence to a few paragraphs. The form needs at least a few words and accepts up to about 1,000 characters. If the drafts feel generic, add names, services, location and mood."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I write the prompt in Spanish, Hindi or another language?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, any language works, and the AI writes the site in the same language as your prompt. You can add other language versions later with the built-in translation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the AI build a site from a picture instead of text?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Upload a screenshot of a website you admire, a design mockup or a photo of a paper sketch. The AI works out the layout and styling from the image and produces a version you can edit block by block."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What if none of the four designs fits?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Run the generator again, since every run gives new variations. It also helps to add what was missing the first time, such as the mood, the colors or the sections you expected."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I edit without writing more prompts?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every generated page opens in the visual editor, where you click text to change it, drag blocks around and adjust each block's settings with the mouse."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does the site look right on phones?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Generated pages fit phones, tablets and large screens automatically, and you can preview each screen size while editing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use Mobirise AI on my phone?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. It runs in the mobile browser, so you can write a prompt, review the drafts and make edits without installing anything."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Mobirise AI make an online shop?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Tell the AI what you sell, and the draft includes product cards with prices and a cart with checkout. You then add your own product photos and descriptions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where is my site hosted?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"On free Mobirise hosting with a subdomain and SSL, on your own domain, or with any other provider if you publish to it directly or upload the downloaded files."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I download the HTML code of the website the AI creates?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, at any time. The download is a folder of ordinary HTML, CSS and JavaScript, ready to run on any web server and open in any code editor."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a desktop version?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The same Mobirise, with the same AI, is available as a free desktop app that runs on Windows, macOS and Linux computers. It also lets you keep editing offline, while generating and publishing need a connection."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Mobirise AI good for SEO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Generated pages come with a logical heading structure, titles, meta descriptions and light code that loads fast, which is what search engines and AI assistants need to understand a page. You can also edit the SEO settings of each page yourself."}}]}]}</script>
